*   Charitable donation: $720
*   State and Local Taxes (SALT): Your California state income taxes withheld from your W-2 (capped at $10,000).

**Verdict:** Unless your California state income taxes plus your $720 donation exceed $14,600, **you should take the Standard Deduction**. It will give you a larger tax benefit. *(Note: You still get to deduct your home office, student loan interest, and 1099 expenses even if you take the standard deduction!)*

